<title>UK: IPE gas oil called steady to up 25 cents, quiet.</title>
<headline>IPE gas oil called steady to up 25 cents, quiet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPE gas oil was expected to open unchanged to 25 cents higher on Monday with no fresh news seen over the weekend, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It looks like we'll have a quiet start to the week. There's no news around,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>Similarly, Brent looked set for a quiet, steady start to the week.</p>
